    narr:narration """Quinton Fairweather has established a new [mandatory release protocol](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) for all Meridian deployments, requiring a signed manifest to proceed. This directive, framed as a [formal gate](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3), is explicitly [scoped to both staging and production](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4). Fairweather anchors this decision in [past operational failures](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2), citing the unauthorized arrival of unsigned artifacts in staging as the primary catalyst for the change. He maintains [direct ownership](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5) of this policy, utilizing a terse, authoritative register to define the new requirement.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The policy is justified by a specific past failure, contrasting with the abstract, forward-looking nature of the mandate itself." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "register" ; narr:reading "shifts from formal, technical precision in policy declarations to a plain-spoken, reactive tone when explaining the rationale." ; narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "style" ; narr:reading "favors a short, punchy cadence that emphasizes decisiveness and clear boundaries." ; narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "conviction" ; narr:reading "consistently lands on authoritative decision-making, leaving no room for ambiguity." ; narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
